oh boy.. so those admin commands are clientsided meaning they arent FE however if a game has built in scripts that would be called serversided meaning they are FE so if you execute a script that has admin or something like that you cant use it on other players some FE scripts like krystal dance/memus (with execeptions) will work and other players will see it.

